# GitHub's language detection counts bytes, so the 650 KB of exploratory
# notebooks and the 430 KB of LaTeX sources would otherwise drown out the
# 90 KB Python package that is the actual codebase. Both really are
# documentation, so mark them as such: the repository then reports Python
# (and MATLAB, for the original prototype), which is what it contains.
*.ipynb linguist-documentation
report/** linguist-documentation
docs/** linguist-documentation

# Keep notebook diffs readable rather than one enormous JSON line.
*.ipynb -diff

# Binary assets: never try to merge or diff them as text.
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
